                <p><strong className="text-green-400">1. SCAN:</strong> Walk through each room. The Officer will identify items.</p>
                <p><strong className="text-green-400">2. VERIFY:</strong> Confirm contents (e.g., "Full Dresser") for accurate box counts.</p>
                <p><strong className="text-green-400">3. DIVERT:</strong> Identify heavy items for Base Exchange credit.</p>
            </div>

